34007e90 <HAL_DCMIPP_PIPE_IsEnabledISPColorConversion>:
  * @param  hdcmipp  Pointer to DCMIPP handle
  * @param  Pipe     Pipe to be checked
  * @retval State of bit (1 or 0).
  */
